@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+## Why
+
+The school wants to reward customers who stay longer: a rental of 3 days or more should cost 10% less than its full price.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Rentals of 3 or more days get 10% off the full price (daily price times days).
+- Quotes and bookings both show the reduced total; a booking's total equals the quote for the same request.
+- Rentals of 1 or 2 days are unchanged.
+- The reduced total is rounded to the nearest euro cent, halves rounding up (assumption, see design).
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+None.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+- `rental`: the Quote requirement (and so Booking, which totals like a quote) now applies the long-rental discount.
+
+## Impact
+
+- Affects rentals (quotes and bookings) for students and visitors alike. Lessons and customers are not affected.
+- Code: pricing in `src/index.ts`; tests in `test/rental.test.ts`.
+- No runtime dependency is introduced.
+
+## Scope
+
+In scope: the 10% discount from 3 days on `quote` and `book` totals.
+
+Out of scope: other discount tiers, per-customer-kind pricing, season-dependent pricing, changes to the API shape (no new fields such as a discount amount), cancellations.
